@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "Staff" as User
participant "StaffPage" as UI
participant "FieldOperationController" as Controller
participant "FieldOperationService" as Service
participant "SlotGenerationService" as Generator
participant "SlotRepository / BookingRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

== UC-17: View Field Operation Calendar ==

User -> UI : 1. Choose an operation date
activate User
activate UI

UI -> UI : 2. useEffect([calendarDate])
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI -> UI : 3. Validate form/filter state
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI -> Controller : 4. GET /api/operations/calendar?date
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. operationCalendar(date)
activate Service

Service -> Service : 6. requireOperator(); default to today
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
  Service -> Generator : 7. ensureDate(targetDate)
  activate Generator
  Generator -> Repo : 8. Materialize missing slots from Admin rules
  activate Repo
  Repo -> DB : 9. SELECT rules/current slots; INSERT missing rows
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 10. Current daily calendar
  deactivate DB
  Repo --> Generator : 11. Created count
  deactivate Repo
  Generator --> Service : 12. Date ready
  deactivate Generator

  Service -> Repo : 13. findBySlotDate; findBySlot_SlotDate...
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 14. SELECT slots and bookings for date
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 15. Calendar rows
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Service : 16. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 17. Merge booking into each slot; sort by field/time
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    Non-operator -> HTTP 403
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 18. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 19. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> UI : 20. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

UI -> UI : 21. setCalendarRows(response.data)
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI --> User : 22. Display operational statuses

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
